            "review_title": "Review at Yeije Korean Restaurant",
            "review_text": "AnthonyT407\nSingapore76 contributions\n0\nLunch\nAug 2016 • Family\nDelicious with nice ambience, we ordered the ribs which was marinated and cooked beautifully. The kimchi that came with it was of high quality. The soup dumpling was scrumptious, and as a icing on the cake, the complimentary desert at end was very delicious.\nThis is our fav Korean restaurant in HCM!\nWritten August 21, 2016",
