            "review_title": "Review at Yeije Korean Restaurant",
            "review_text": "edwin771\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam11 contributions\n0\nTraditional Korean food.\nMar 2016 • Friends\nIt's located on the 3rd floor of Bitexco in HCMC. I have visited this restaurant few times only for lunch. The place is very nice & tidy and I could feel the traditional Korean atmosphere. At the entrance, two staff in traditional clothing called Hanbok is welcoming us, and Hanbok was reaally beautiful.\nService was extremely fine. Every staff was well trainded, they always stood near the customers. \nQuality of main food is good, and price for lunch is reasonable. And several delicious side dishes were served. But price for beef and pork is little pricey. I think this place is good for company dinner or entertaining guests.\nIt was nice experience, worth a try this restaurant!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 3, 2016\nmkshin626\nDear Edwin, thank you for dining at Yeije several times already and thank you for your kind review. As a newly opened restaurant, every words you said means a lot to us and all of our staffs. We will keep try our best to serve our guests to have wonderful dining experience at Yeije. Thank you again and it would be nice to welcome you again soon!\nRead more\nWritten March 26, 2016\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
